# Code owners.
#
# Review is cross-review (the TZ): any teammate's approval merges any change, and code-owner review
# is not required by the rulesets (.github/rulesets/main.json). This file only makes GitHub ask the
# lead to look at the few paths where a change can quietly weaken every other check: CI and
# repository rules, and the shared lint presets. The lead reviews those with AI; a teammate's
# approval still counts.
#
# - The last matching pattern wins, so keep broad patterns above narrow ones.
# - An owner must have write access to the repository, or GitHub ignores the line.

/.github/               @soadap
/packages/config/       @soadap
